v4.0.0
    New features
      - Ability to run multiple scripts on the same server.
      - New interface for events that allows multiple functions to
        subscribe to one event.

    Feature changes
      - UsingClasses renamed to GetUseClasses for consistency. UsingClasses
        UsingClasses will continue to exist but is now a deprecated name.
      - HideMapObject and ShowMapObject now require the use of Vectors.
      - Player.Weapon can now be set using Player.Weapon = WeaponID, which
        will automatically give the player that weapon with 5000 ammo.
      - Player.Ammo can now be set using Player.Ammo = Amount, which is
        identical to Player.SetWeapon(Player.Weapon, Amount)

    Bugfixes

    Removed features
      - CreateRadioStream no longer allows specifying an ID. The plugin will
        instead always assign an ID automatically.
      - Vector-expanded functions such as SetSpawnPlayerPos(x, y, z) have
        been removed. Such functions now require the use of a Vector instead.
      - Removed Player.SetMarker(). Use Player.HasMarker instead.
      - Removed Player.SetDrunkLevel(). Use Player.IsDrunk until the ability
        to set drunk level returns to the server.

    Removed deprecated features
      - Deprecated LoadModule removed.
      - Deprecated SetAmmuWeapon, IsAmmuWeaponEnabled and SetAmmuWeaponEnabled
        all removed.
      - Deprecated GetTime and GetFullTime removed.
      - Deprecated GetFallEnabled and SetFallEnabled removed.
      - Deprecated GetDeathmatchScoreboard and SetDeathmatchScoreboard removed.
      - Deprecated GetWeaponSync and SetWeaponSync removed.
      - Deprecated GetWeatherLock and SetWeatherLock removed.
      - Deprecated GetMapName and SetMapName removed.
      - Deprecated GetSkinID removed.

v3.99
    Initial public release of 0.4-squirrel